                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Beat the Blitz is a VR Infomercial educational program with game elements.  It worked on my HTC Vive and Index system, looked ok, played ok, sounded ok.  Gatorade poured some money into this game program.  You will workout your football throwing arm.  You need a clear head space to the ceiling to be able to throw footballs effectively.  This game requires 3m x 3m but you can get by with 2m x 2m just to play casually.  Has a tutorial.  \n\nTry it, you might like it.\n\nFor more info:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vfThmGzuy8E\n\nhttp://www.themill.com/portfolio/4236/beat-the-blitz-vr-experience-\n\nhttp://www.gatorade.com/beattheblitz/",
